<title>JAPAN: Almetax Mfg - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Almetax Mfg - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  9.73		vs	    8.54</p>
<p> Operating	  672 million	 vs	  522 million</p>
<p> Current	    592 million	 vs	  503 million</p>
<p> Net		  324 million	 vs	  275 million</p>
<p> EPS		   29.96 yen	  vs	   26.35 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     11 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Almetax Manufacturing Co Ltd is a producer of aluminium building materials for housing use.</p>
</text>
